It is also recommended that a sketch plan of the proposed development be submitted by the subdivider for review at this time. The sketch plan should contain the following official data which may be obtained from base maps available at the county building/administration office, the county tax assessor's office, local United States Natural Resources Conservation Service (NRCS) office, or the Southwest Georgia Regional Development Center:
